# Cloudflare Pages Caching Headers for Blood Match Software
/*.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate

/
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.mp4
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/*.jpg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
